## 4. Page specifications

### Page 1: Executive Pulse
**Question answered:** Is the business healthy right now?

```
+--------+--------+--------+--------+--------+--------+
| Revenue| Profit | Margin%| Orders |  AOV   | Units  |   <- KPI cards (value, YoY %, sparkline)
+--------+--------+--------+--------+--------+--------+
| Revenue vs Prior Year (line, 60%) | Revenue->Profit      |
|                                   | Waterfall (40%)      |
+-----------------------------------+----------------------+
| Top 5 Territories (bar) | Category mix (donut/bar) | Alerts |
+-------------------------+--------------------------+--------+
```

### Page 2: Growth Opportunities
**Question:** Where should we invest?
- Territory map (bubble size = revenue, color = margin)
- Category x Territory heatmap (revenue or margin, toggled)
- Pareto chart: products ranking cumulative to 80% of revenue
- Customer segment comparison (Online vs. Store; new vs. returning)
- Drill-through: Territory -> Product -> Customer

### Page 3: Profitability Deep Dive
**Question:** Where do we make or lose money?
- Margin % by subcategory (sorted bar)
- Scatter: volume (x) vs. margin % (y), bubble = revenue; quadrant lines at average
- Discount band analysis (0%, 1-10%, 11-20%, 20%+) vs. margin
- Promotion performance table (revenue, margin, discount cost)
- Low-margin product watchlist

### Page 4: Operational Success
**Question:** Is the organization executing?
- Rep leaderboard with quota attainment bullet chart
- Average fulfilment days trend + distribution
- Ship method comparison (cost % and speed)
- Freight % of sales by territory

### Page 5: Forecast & Insights
**Question:** What happens next, and what is unusual?
- Revenue forecast with confidence band (from Python, `ds.RevenueForecast`)
- Customer segments from RFM clustering (`ds.CustomerSegment`): size, revenue, profile cards
- Anomaly timeline: flagged unusual weeks/months

## 5. Interaction design

| Feature | Behavior |
|---|---|
| Metric toggle | Switch charts among Revenue / Profit / Units (field parameter) |
| Time intelligence | MTD, QTD, YTD, Rolling 12M selector |
| Drill-through | Right-click any product/territory -> detail page |
| Tooltips | Hover shows a mini trend chart |
| Cross-filtering | Clicking a visual filters others on the page |
| Reset button | Clears all slicers and bookmarks |
| Info icon | Shows the KPI definition from the dictionary |

## 6. Accessibility and quality checklist

- [ ] Contrast ratio at least 4.5:1 for text
- [ ] Meaning never conveyed by color alone (add arrows or labels)
- [ ] Every visual has a title that states what it shows
- [ ] Tab order and alt text set
- [ ] Performance: page loads in under 3 seconds
- [ ] Numbers reconcile to the source (see data quality checks)

